    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"scripting or targeted communication\"... that hits home. i knew it felt off. if these clusters are being used for that, it means the way we speak might actually be working against us without us knowing. \n\ncan you help me understand how to spot this more effectively? if i'm reading something and i suspect it's a \"signal\" rather than just boring news, what are the specific linguistic indicators i should be looking for to tell the difference between natural language and these embedded markers?",
